Viktor 13.10.2026: «Мой Буратино реп без Q ожил»; on КРИК: «Теперь лирика не зависит от такта». The engine: free_tempo takes the Q: lines and [Q:…] fields out of the score after it is planned or supplied, before the music stage and before a plan asked alone is returned. The page: «Free tempo» between the Style's name and the voice's toggles, sent with a score; on by itself when the Style asks for rubato or non-linear without a BPM; «Want non-linearity or rubato? Remove the BPM from your style!» under the box when a BPM stands there; the draft, a take's settings and a prompt file keep it; the medcard says it. A score without its tempo reads as native (the nominal 120, «free tempo» in the summary). Eleven catalogs.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
